nt aspect of the solution. The solution, thus, comes to be finding the total probability of each Ngram to be written by the particular author in the email.","topics":[],"score":258162,"global_rank":52327,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9848},{"name":"viveksainanee/warbler","owner":"viveksainanee","html_url":"https://github.com/viveksainanee/warbler","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Full-stack application to share posts and direct message each other, built with Python (Flask) and Jinja","topics":[],"score":258156,"global_rank":52333,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9849},{"name":"brydavis/aws_ml","owner":"brydavis","html_url":"https://github.com/brydavis/aws_ml","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Examples of AWS Machine Learning Services","topics":[],"score":258148,"global_rank":52337,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9850}]